>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_SAFE_STEP_TAC`

``` hol4
classicalLib.CS_SAFE_STEP_TAC : clasetLib.claset -> NTactical.ntactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the claset-explicit form of `SAFE_STEP_TAC`.

`CS_SAFE_STEP_TAC cs` performs one matching safe step on the selected
goal. It takes `cs` directly, exposes every result, and does not process
theorem-list markers.

### Failure

Produces no result when no safe step applies.

